        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A classic pine tree with a tall dark green cone canopy and a short brown cylinder trunk. The cone is worked from the tip downward, increasing gradually, which gives the piece its characteristic tapering silhouette. Stuff the canopy firmly so it keeps its point."
          }
        ]
      },
